{
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "一段历史可交易区间：UTC 半开区间 `[tradable_from, tradable_until)`（ADR-0024 §1）。\n\n`tradable_until` **必须显式给出**：`null` 表示仍可交易（开放区间），不提供默认值，避免\"漏写结束\n时间\"被读成\"仍在交易\"。区间非空：`tradable_from < tradable_until`。按 `simulation_time` 判断是否\n可交易：`tradable_from <= simulation_time < tradable_until`。",
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
      "default": "2.6.0",
      "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
      "title": "Schema Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "tradable_from": {
      "format": "date-time",
      "title": "Tradable From",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "tradable_until": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "format": "date-time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Tradable Until"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "tradable_from",
    "tradable_until"
  ],
  "title": "TradableInterval",
  "type": "object"
}
